ed cabinet sized to the pairs allowed by the door.",{"children":"Shoes: a washable tray, narrow rack, or closed cabinet sized to the pairs allowed by the door."}],"$Le","$Lf","$L10"]}]]}],"$L11"]}],"$L12","$L13"]}]
