11:["$","section","Measure the pinch points",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Measure the pinch points"}],[["$","p","Measure door swing, walkway width, baseboards, outlets, and the tallest shoes before ordering furniture. A slim product listing can still be too deep for a narrow traffic path.",{"children":"Measure door swing, walkway width, baseboards, outlets, and the tallest shoes before ordering furniture. A slim product listing can still be too deep for a narrow traffic path."}],["$","p","Open storage is faster to use but visually busier. Closed storage looks calmer but needs clearance and an easy handle. Choose based on what the household will actually maintain.",{"children":"Open storage is faster to use but visually busier. Closed storage looks calmer but needs clearance and an easy handle. Choose based on what the household will actually maintain."}]],"$undefined"]}]
